Output docs/media/todo.gif
Source docs/media/tapes/common.tape

Hide
Type "export ORG_DEMO_DIR=/tmp/org-demo-todo; clear; nvim -u docs/media/demo/init.lua $ORG_DEMO_DIR/notes.org" Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Show
Sleep 1s
Shift+Tab Sleep 400ms
Shift+Tab Sleep 1s
Type "/changelog" Enter Sleep 600ms
Ctrl+C Ctrl+C Sleep 800ms
Type "j" Ctrl+C Ctrl+C Sleep 800ms
Type "j" Ctrl+C Ctrl+C Sleep 1.2s
Type "/Configuration" Enter Sleep 600ms
Type " oT" Sleep 1.5s
Type "d" Sleep 1.5s
Type "/Screenshots" Enter Sleep 600ms
Type "cit" Sleep 1s
Type " o," Sleep 1s
Type "A" Sleep 1.5s
Sleep 1s
